OL,3,GNEWSAOver 60's offered free road safety
OL,4,Acourse
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers aged 60 and over from the Black
OL,7,FCountry can take part in a free road
OL,8,Fsafety course next month.
OL,10,FDudley Council said it was "committed
OL,11,Fto helping people retain their
OL,12,Findependent mobility whilst remaining
OL,13,Fsafe on the road".
OL,15,FDrivers from any of the Black Country
OL,16,Fboroughs can book onto the course,
OL,17,Finvolving National Highways, West
OL,18,FMidlands Police and councils, with the
OL,19,Ffirst being held in Wolverhampton in
OL,20,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
