OL,3,GNEWSAOver 60's offered free road safety
OL,4,Acourse
OL,5,
OL,6,FSessions have been offered with the aim
OL,7,F"to raise awareness of gradual
OL,8,Freduction in eyesight, decision making
OL,9,Fand reaction time, to enable drivers to
OL,10,Frecognise them and take action to
OL,11,Faddress any potential problems".
